[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2023-12-06T10:13:28Z","updated_at":"2023-12-06T12:31:06Z","closed_at":"2023-12-06T12:30:59Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/pulls/17578","html_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/17578","diff_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/17578.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/17578.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"The `yield` should be after all settings changes have been applied (not that this context manager is used with more than one setting override) and the clean up should happen when the context manager exits, not after the end of the test. This is because the context manager is used multiple times within the same test.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/17578/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/17578/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/14899","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/14899/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/14899/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/14899/events","html_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/14899","id":1007311612,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAD-Lgs4sRp6_","number":14899,"title":"Fixed #30398 -- Added CONN_HEALTH_CHECKS database setting.","user":{"login":"suligap","id":1270737,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzA3Mzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1270737?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/suligap","html_url":"https://github.com/suligap","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suligap/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suligap/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suligap/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suligap/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suligap/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suligap/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suligap/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suligap/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suligap/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"felixxm","id":2865885,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjU4ODU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2865885?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixxm","html_url":"https://github.com/felixxm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixxm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixxm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixxm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixxm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixxm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixxm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixxm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixxm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixxm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":9,"created_at":"2021-09-26T07:53:08Z","updated_at":"2021-12-01T07:23:53Z","closed_at":"2021-12-01T07:23:53Z","assignee":{"login":"felixxm","id":2865885,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjU4ODU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2865885?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixxm","html_url":"https://github.com/felixxm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixxm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixxm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixxm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixxm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixxm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixxm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixxm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixxm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/felixxm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/pulls/14899","html_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/14899","diff_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/14899.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/14899.patch","merged_at":"2021-12-01T07:23:53Z"},"body":"Introduce `CONN_HEALTH_CHECKS` DB setting which can be used to enable database connection health checks for Django's persistent DB connections.\r\n\r\nIf it's set to `False` (default), the behavior is the same as without this change.\r\n\r\nIf it's set to `True`, then health checks are enabled. They work as follows (assuming an already existing \"persistent\" DB connection):\r\n\r\n- Before each connection reuse, perform a connection test (eg. `SELECT 1` query in case of PostgreSQL).\r\n\r\n- This only happens once per request, regardless of how many DB transactions will be performed during the handling of the request.\r\n\r\n- This only happens for \"requests\" that do use the database.\r\n\r\n- If the check fails, close the connection and create a new one.\r\n\r\nFixes [30398](https://code.djangoproject.com/ticket/30398). Some prior discussion also exists in #11311 and #11335.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/14899/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/14899/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/11335","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/11335/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/11335/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/11335/events","html_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/11335","id":441145646,"node_id":"MDExOlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0Mjc2NTI4OTcw","number":11335,"title":"[WIP] Fixed #30398 -- Added CONN_HEALTH_CHECKS db setting","user":{"login":"suligap","id":1270737,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzA3Mzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1270737?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/suligap","html_url":"https://github.com/suligap","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suligap/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suligap/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suligap/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suligap/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suligap/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suligap/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suligap/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suligap/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/suligap/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2019-05-07T09:56:31Z","updated_at":"2020-04-30T15:18:47Z","closed_at":"2020-04-01T06:02:37Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/pulls/11335","html_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/11335","diff_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/11335.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/11335.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This is a proof of concept solution for [ticket 30398](https://code.djangoproject.com/ticket/30398), with no docs or tests yet.\r\n\r\nIntroduce a `CONN_HEALTH_CHECKS` DB setting to Django which can be used to enable database connection health checks for Django's [persistent DB connections](https://docs.djangoproject.com/en/2.2/ref/databases/#persistent-connections).\r\n\r\nIf it's set to `False` (default), the behavior is the same as without this change.\r\n\r\nIf it's set to `True`, then health checks are enabled. They work as\r\nfollows (assuming an already existing \"persistent\" DB connection):\r\n\r\n- Before each connection reuse, perform a connection test\r\n  (eg. `SELECT 1` query in case of PostgreSQL).\r\n\r\n- This only happens once per request, regardless of how many DB\r\n  transactions will be performed during the handling of the request.\r\n\r\n- This only happens for \"requests\" that do use the database.\r\n\r\n- If the check fails, close the connection and create a new one.\r\n\r\nMore info about the rationale and motivation in the [ticket 30398](https://code.djangoproject.com/ticket/30398).\r\n\r\n----\r\nThis is a simpler alternative to #11311 (thanks @apollo13 for the suggestion to drop the checks based on the timer), with the general approach being the same.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/11335/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/11335/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}